flowchart TB
accTitle: Authorize the destination key before snapshot copying
accDescr: A destination snapshot copy grant permits encryption with its customer managed KMS key. Redshift copies source snapshots to that Region for later restoration.
subgraph SRC[Source Region]
C[Encrypted Redshift cluster]:::process --> S[(Source snapshot)]:::storage
end
subgraph DST[Destination Region more than 500 miles away]
K[Customer managed KMS key]:::storage --> G[Snapshot copy grant]:::reference
D[(Destination encrypted snapshot)]:::storage --> R[Restore new Redshift cluster]:::process
end
G -.->|Authorizes destination encryption| D
S -->|Managed cross-Region snapshot copy| D
R --> O[Recovery after restore and validation]:::output
